&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verve has created a more efficient and privacy-focused way to buy and monetize advertising. Verve is an ecosystem of demand and supply technologies fusing data, media, and technology together to deliver results and growth to both advertisers and publishers–no matter the screen or location, no matter who, what, or where a customer is. With offices across the globe and with an eye on servicing forward-thinking advertising customers, Verve’s solutions are trusted by more than 90 of the United States’ top 100 advertisers, 4,000 publishers globally, and the world’s top demand-side platforms. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/&quot;&gt;verve.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are currently seeking a Senior Product Manager to own our Identity Graph / Enrichment &amp;amp; Audience Enhancement products. You will lead an already established Identity &amp;amp; Audience team to grow Verve&#39;s presence in the AdTech space through the innovative execution of key strategic initiatives. The successful candidate will participate in the development of the product strategy and product roadmaps, leading product initiatives end-to-end from ideation to launch and go-to-market. They will inform product requirements, collaborate with engineering on implementation, take products to market through extensive A/B testing &amp;amp; experimentation, and be responsible for commercial success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow our Identity Graph / Enrichment &amp;amp; Audience Enhancement products&#39; impact based on the data-driven insights that shape your roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the product increments we build are aligned with the overall strategy and product vision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and lead product development end-to-end from discovery to launch to iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Come up with hypotheses, run experiments, and holdout tests to quantify the incremental value of identity and audience features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate daily with engineering, data, and product teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep building the knowledge of the market landscape, including the needs of publishers, advertisers, and DSPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle communication with internal/external stakeholders &amp;amp; partners&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and map out cross-product dependencies with the other business units&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and monitor product KPIs to make sure the initiatives are driving product &amp;amp; business success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience in product management roles, at least 2+ years of product management experience in the AdTech industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem solver - You can capture business problems, come up with solutions, and write good product requirement documents to keep everyone aligned on the scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technically skilled - You have a good understanding of databases, data structures, and how software systems can be integrated and exchange data with each other&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter &amp;amp; self-motivator - you don’t wait to be told what needs to be done; you take full ownership of product initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborator &amp;amp; communicator - you can gather tech and business stakeholders across functions &amp;amp; levels around you to work towards a common goal, speaking their language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achiever - You focus on outcomes &amp;amp; prefer to have something done rather than have it perfect; you value an iterative process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven - you value the power of data and can perform data analysis to make decisions / assess results based on metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Just a few of the benefits waiting for you at Verve:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with 3 &lt;strong&gt;Wellness Days &lt;/strong&gt;throughout the year, in addition to your annual vacation and public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your mental well-being with our &lt;strong&gt;Workplace Mental Health Solution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boost your professional knowledge with our annual &lt;strong&gt;training budget &amp;amp; internal webinars&lt;/strong&gt;, and level up your language skills through our &lt;strong&gt;German/English classes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen team connections while exploring new cultures through our monthly &lt;strong&gt;Work&amp;amp;Travel raffle,&lt;/strong&gt; offering a chance to work from one of our global offices (after 2 years of employment)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;… and even more reasons to join us!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Verve provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you are a California resident subject to the California Consumer Privacy Act, &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/california-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;If you are located in the EU or UK visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot; href=&quot;https://verve.com/applicant-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Ledgy, we’re on a mission to make Europe a powerhouse of entrepreneurship by building a modern, tech-driven equity management and financial reporting platform for private and public companies. In 2026, we aim to be the leading provider for European IPOs and reporting for share-based payments. We are a value-based company with a core focus on being humble, transparent, ambitious and impactful, all in order to delivery the best experience for our customers and end users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to partner with some of the world’s leading investors. New Enterprise Associates led our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2022/09/21/ledgy-a-carta-for-european-startups-to-manage-equity-and-cap-tables-raises-22m-from-nea-sequoia-and-more/&quot;&gt;$22m Series B&lt;/a&gt; round in 2022, with Philip Chopin joining Sequoia’s Luciana Lixandru on our board.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We were founded in Switzerland in 2017 and today we operate globally from offices in Zurich and London. We encourage diversity and are an international team coming from 26 different countries and speaking 25 different languages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior DevOps Engineer at Ledgy, you&#39;ll build the infrastructure and tooling that help our engineers ship quickly and reliably. You&#39;ll join our Platform team, collaborating with engineers and InfoSec to improve CI/CD, observability, and cloud infrastructure for a product that helps companies manage equity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our challenge is to make delivery faster, production easier to operate, and AI-assisted development safer - while keeping complexity and costs in check.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; We hire remotely across Spain, Germany, Poland, and Romania.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team you&#39;ll join:&lt;/strong&gt; Platform - Builds the infrastructure and tooling that help our engineers ship quickly and reliably, working with InfoSec to improve CI/CD, observability, and cloud infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud infrastructure.&lt;/strong&gt; Evolve our GCP and Kubernetes cloud architecture and setup with Terraform, improving reliability, simplicity, and cost visibility and enabling scaling to multiple availability regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD and developer experience.&lt;/strong&gt; Speed up feedback loops, reduce flaky builds, and turn recurring support requests into self-service tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Observability.&lt;/strong&gt; Reduce alert noise, define meaningful SLOs, and make production issues easier to diagnose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security and automation.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with InfoSec on secure delivery, access controls, and guardrails for AI-assisted workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll also join our incident-response on-call rotation during working hours and help prevent recurring issues. As we expand our servicing of public companies and jurisdictions, this on-call might evolve to compensated 24h/7 hour rotation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll Thrive in This Role If You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Don&#39;t worry if you don&#39;t tick every box. These are the things that would make you an especially good fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong DevOps / SRE background designing and operating cloud infrastructure and production systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked with Kubernetes and infrastructure as code, ideally GCP and Terraform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy building fast, reliable CI/CD pipelines and improving developer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can diagnose issues across networking, infrastructure, and application code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write maintainable code and bring a practical approach to observability and security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Value collaboration, mentorship, and thoughtful trade-offs between reliability, complexity, and cost&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are curious about supporting AI-assisted development safely - no AI specialism required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with Node.js, MongoDB or Temporal is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work in TypeScript: React, Tailwind CSS, and tRPC on the front end, and tRPC, Node.js, MongoDB, and Temporal on the back end. Infrastructure runs on GCP, Terraform Cloud, Kubernetes, Docker, and GitHub Actions. For observability and incident response we use Grafana, Sentry, and PagerDuty.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t need to know all of it. We don&#39;t expect proficiency in every part of this stack. Strong infrastructure fundamentals and the ability to learn matter more than knowing every tool already.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Your Journey Could Look Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 30 days:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get to know Ledgy, the Platform team, and our internal users with an onboarding buddy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore our infrastructure and delivery workflows, and ship your first improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze current state of our cloud infrastructure and propose meaningful enhancements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 3 months:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently deliver improvements to CI/CD, observability, or infrastructure design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share operational ownership and help reduce recurring friction for engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to architecture discussions and document what others need to operate our systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 6-12 months:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own DevOps and SRE function and DevOps initiatives from problem definition through rollout and adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver measurable improvements to developer experience, reliability, or cost&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape our platform&#39;s direction and mentor other engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Getting to know you (45 min):&lt;/strong&gt; Meet with someone from our people team to talk about your experience and to ask questions about the role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Live Coding (60 min):&lt;/strong&gt; An equity domain problem to solve collaboratively using your preferred language and IDE. We want to see how you think, so this step does not allow AI. But you can freely look up syntax questions if you need to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Design (60 min):&lt;/strong&gt; A system design session where you will design an architecture for a problem from the Ledgy domain using a visual tool of your choice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DDSA (45 min):&lt;/strong&gt; A Deep Dive into real System Architecture that you have built, owned and monitored.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture Interview:&lt;/strong&gt; A chance to meet one of our founders and your hiring manager for a 30-minute chat about Ledgy&#39;s mission and values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Offer&lt;/strong&gt; 🎉&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Being part of Ledgy means&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge and re-energize with flexible working hours, 25 days of vacation, and up to 40 days of remote work from outside your home country.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We make space for your own professional development, with a generous yearly learning &amp;amp; development budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will receive a competitive salary + benefits + equity. All salaries are aligned with competitively benchmarked ranges based on work location and levelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Per the EU Pay Transparency Directive, the pay range for this role is listed below for all legally required countries. Pay within the range reflects your skills, experience and the scope of the role, and is set using objective criteria applied consistently across the team. Certain roles are also eligible for additional rewards including variable pay under the applicable plan. Ledgy offers equity through our employee option plan. Benefits offered vary by country and type of employment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Spain pay range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€79.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€97.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Xometry (NASDAQ: XMTR) powers the industries of today and tomorrow by connecting the people with big ideas to the manufacturers who can bring them to life. Xometry’s digital marketplace gives manufacturers the critical resources they need to grow their business while also making it easy for buyers at Fortune 1000 companies to tap into global manufacturing capacity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Engineering Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to lead a team of software engineers that owns a core part of our AI-powered manufacturing marketplace. In this role, you will be accountable for both what the team ships and how its engineers grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Xometry connects buyers who need custom parts with a global network of manufacturers, with our platform handling instant quoting, pricing, order routing, supplier management, and payments. Reporting to the Director of Engineering, you will manage engineers directly, own your team&#39;s roadmap and operations, and work closely with product, design, and operations partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;You will be accountable for your team&#39;s delivery, the reliability of its systems, and the growth of every engineer on it, driving high engineering standards and cross-functional alignment from our Munich, Germany location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;How You&#39;ll Contribute:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;People and Organization:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Hire, onboard, coach, and retain a team of engineers, from early-career to senior and staff&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,1,1,0&quot;&gt;Set clear expectations, give timely feedback, and run fair performance and promotion processes; address underperformance directly&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,1,2,0&quot;&gt;Grow senior engineers into technical leaders and build a pipeline of future team leads&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,1,3,0&quot;&gt;Build a team culture of ownership, psychological safety, and high engineering standards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;Delivery and Execution:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Own the team&#39;s roadmap: plan, size, sequence, and de-risk work, and deliver on commitments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,1,1,0&quot;&gt;Agree on dates and outcomes with product partners, and surface trade-offs and risks early&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,1,2,0&quot;&gt;Run operational excellence: availability, latency, on-call health, incident reviews, resiliency, and cost efficiency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,1,3,0&quot;&gt;Use metrics (delivery predictability, quality, customer impact) to find problems and to show progress&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;Technical Strategy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Set the technical direction for your team&#39;s systems for the next 1–2 years, including build-versus-buy decisions and managing technical debt&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,1,1,0&quot;&gt;Review designs and key technical decisions for scalability, security, data integrity, and maintainability, and dive deep when needed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,1,2,0&quot;&gt;Apply machine learning and automation where they improve quoting accuracy, pricing, routing, or supplier matching&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,1,3,0&quot;&gt;Work with principal engineers and peer managers to align on shared platforms and standards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Work with product, design, data science, operations, and finance to define problems and measurable goals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,1,1,0&quot;&gt;Represent your team in planning, budget, and headcount discussions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,1,2,0&quot;&gt;Resolve dependencies with neighboring teams and escalate early&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring to Xometry:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;Experience: 8+ years of software engineering experience, including 3+ years managing software engineers directly&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot;&gt;Production Delivery: Track record of leading a team that delivered complex systems in production with clear business impact&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot;&gt;Operational Excellence: Experience owning operational health, including on-call, incident response, SLAs, resiliency, and cost management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot;&gt;Team Building &amp;amp; Coaching: Strong hiring and coaching record with proven success building a team, raising the bar, and growing engineers into larger roles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot;&gt;Communication: Clear written and verbal communication with product leaders, executives, and engineers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,5,0&quot;&gt;Education: Bachelor&#39;s degree in computer science or a related field, or equivalent practical experience (Master&#39;s degree in computer science, engineering, or a related field is preferred)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,6,0&quot;&gt;Location: Ability to work from Munich, Germany&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,7,0&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10,7,1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,7,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Experience in a two-sided marketplace, e-commerce, supply chain, or manufacturing technology&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,7,1,1,0&quot;&gt;Experience with large-scale data platforms, workflow engines, or payments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,7,1,2,0&quot;&gt;Experience leading through acquisition, integration, or a major re-platforming&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,7,1,3,0&quot;&gt;Background at a company that nurtures ownership and high-bar hiring&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_cc45f66316188860-101&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid, 2-3 days per week in the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary structure: base salary + annual bonus + RSUs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;28 PTOs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team spirit and friendly atmosphere:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;we work in an open, friendly and trusting environment that welcomes initiative. In the Xometry team, everyone is ready to help and support in difficult times, and we always celebrate victories together and appreciate the contribution of everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development opportunities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;we are a fast growing company, each new task is an interesting challenge for the team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We care:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;ongoing free of charge well-being activities for our people, charity projects worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;speed and flexibility are some of our advantages, allowing us to achieve amazing results. We have flexible processes and planning, we can respond to rapidly changing conditions and remain effective in the face of uncertainty.&lt;/p&gt;
